The W2 kernel stores 123.0 BF16 for every valid route/channel in sentinel mode.
After the weighted k6 reduction, every one of the 8*4096 output elements is
nonzero and the BF16 absmax is 185 (123*1.5 rounded).  Therefore the consumer
reaches and covers the epilogue; the non-debug accumulator path is what is zero.
